demo_type: MULTICOL
title: "Column Rule Width"
target_base_style: "column-count: 3; column-rule-style: solid; column-rule-color: #e94560; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; color: #c0c8d4;"
target_inner_html: "Column rule width controls the thickness of the rule drawn between columns. Values can be keywords like thin, medium, and thick, or explicit lengths like 1px or 5px for precise control over the rule thickness."
